                                <li><strong class="text-white">Database File Size:</strong> <span class="text-success">@Model.DbFileSize</span></li>
                                <li><strong class="text-white">ORM / External Tools:</strong> <span class="badge bg-secondary">0% (Pure ADO.NET)</span></li>
                            </ul>
